## solution

#### using two pointers


```js
const uncompress = (s) => {
  let result = [];
  const numbers = '0123456789';
  let i = 0;
  let j = 0;
  while (j < s.length) {
    if (numbers.includes(s[j])) {
      j += 1;
    } else {
      const num = Number(s.slice(i, j));
      for (let count = 0; count < num; count += 1) {
        result.push(s[j]);
      }
      j += 1;
      i = j;
    }
  }
  return result.join('');
};
```

- n = number of groups
- m = max num found in any group
- Time: O(n*m)
- Space: O(n*m)

